"title":"Quick-Connect Kits for M-Series MCR-6, MCR-10, and MCR-20",
"handle":"quick-connect-kits-for-m-series-mcr-6-mcr-10-and-mcr-20",
"body_html":"<p><span>The Quick-Connect Kits for the M-Series offer owners a way to quickly gang your two exhausts into one line if you are venting your coffee roaster through the roof.</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>Our kits are designed for current models of M-Series Coffee Roasters. If you have a previous generation model, contact us to get the correct kit. </span></li>\n<li><span>All stainless steel venting pipe, elbows and wye branch with heavy-duty, two-part clamps.</span></li>\n<li><span>Made in the USA</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span>These parts will often have long lead times of up to 5 weeks. </span></p>",
